h the augmented matrix $M$, which we reduce using Gaussian elimination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M= & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -2 & -15 \\\\ 4 & -2 & -4 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -2 & -4 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -6 & -4 & -22\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-6){R}_{2} \\\\ ∼ & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 8 & -16\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now \n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=7 \\\\ -{x}_{2}-2{x}_{3}=-1 \\\\ 8{x}_{3}=-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom third equation we get ${x}_{3}=-2$ and substituting this value into the second equation yields ${x}_{2}=-2(-2)+1=5.$ Finally, substituting ${x}_{2}=5$ into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+5=7\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=2+5+(-2)=5.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342384 #edb/ref 1080 "3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342384 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342384 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "10b3425c-3f4f-50ac-9c9d-0a2e7c77dbbd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342791 #edb/ref 1080 "4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342791 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186342791 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "429a3619-daf6-5115-8c01-735449d7217d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186343166 #edb/ref 1080 "-4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186343166 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186343166 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "6ca6b908-2e20-5cef-bb8b-aa67933e5937" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186343306 #edb/ref 1080 "-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186343306 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186343306 #edb/